3_07_13","text":"Suit yourselves.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_14","text":"Before you do that, there's something I wanted to tell you.","jump":"m_main_03_07_15"},{"id":"m_main_03_07_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_15","text":"We found something","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_16","text":"in your quarters at the Outpost.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_17","text":"Military plans outlining an attack on the Ark.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_18","text":"How could that be?","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_19","text":"That's how it is.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_20","text":"It's quite detailed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_21","text":"Everything from attack routes to ideal locations to plant explosives.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_22","text":"This is clearly the doing of those hunks of scrap metal.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_23","text":"Ah, and I forgot to mention. It has your signature as well. Your full endorsement.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_24","text":"We would never do such a thing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_25","text":"I saw it with my own eyes!","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_26","text":"And it's a good thing I did.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_27","text":"Once you return from your trek, you shall be punished accordingly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_28","text":"Understand?","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_29","text":"Now get back to it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_main_03_07_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:m_main_03_07_30","text":"Heh heh.","jump":null}],"chat":true}